    {
      "target": "puppet:sam",
      "text": "Sam was twenty-nine and so nervous he forgot who was carrying the rings."
    },
    {"target": "puppet:lily", "text": "Lily was in charge of the rings, and of keeping Sam calm."},
    {"target": "puppet:mom", "text": "Ana cried through the vows and most of the party."},
